{
    "title": "Moon Phase Calendar",
    "description": "You can check here current phase of the moon, the illumination and the dates of subsequent phases, advanced lunar calendar. You can also find useful information about the sun and weather. The Moon has a strong influence on many spheres of life. Knowing moon phases and astrology helps you distribute the energy properly for days and use it most.\r\n \r\nGet interested in our Moon Phase application if you are:\r\n\ud83c\udf11 Feeling the influence of the Moon on your body - the calendar of the Moon phases will allow you to carefully plan essential events in your life so that the Moon favors the implementation of your plans! With this application you can check about Full Moon, New Moon, First Quarter or Last Quarter and you can properly prepare for them. In addition, you can observe phenomena such as moon distance so you will know when the influence of the Moon is strong and when it is weak!\r\n\ud83c\udf11 An amateur astronomy - with the visualization of the azimuths of the Moon and the Sun will allow a better understanding of the phenomena associated with them. Moon phase app provides a moon-observing index which is calculated according to the moon phenomena and weather such as cloud coverage and chance of rain.\r\n\ud83c\udf11 A stargazer or moongazer - deeply absorbed in thought or contemplation, as if you were gazing at the moon with this lunar scope. Check out moon information before moon watching.\r\n\ud83c\udf11 An outdoor photographer - the view of the sun allows you to check when there is a \"golden hour\" and \"blue hour\", so you can plan to take beautiful and professional photos outdoors.\r\n \r\nCheck out the full list of Moon Phase Calendar features:\r\n \r\n\ud83c\udf19 Moon parameters include:moon phase, moon age, moon distance, vertical angle, azimuth angle, luminance, moon rise and moon set...\r\n\ud83c\udf19 Sun parameters include:sunrise, sunset, dawn, dusk, golden hour & blue hour for photography...\r\n\ud83c\udf19 Weather parameters include: cloud cover, chance of rain, visibility, daily weather, hourly weather...\r\n \r\n\ud83c\udf15 View the moon cycle for any date in the future or past by scrolling on the moon\r\n\ud83c\udf15 Find the upcoming full moon or new moon straight on the main screen\r\n\ud83c\udf15 Track all cycles of the moon: full moon, new moon, waning gibbous, waxing crescent, first quarter\r\n\ud83c\udf15 Set moon phase as phone wallpaper, change in accordance with the real moon!\r\n \r\nTips: to get local weather information, you\u2019ll need to grant location permission.\r\n \r\nIf you want to keep up with the moon or other astronomy information, then <b> Moon Phase Calendar </b> is the right app for you.",
    "descriptionHTML": "You can check here current phase of the moon, the illumination and the dates of subsequent phases, advanced lunar calendar. You can also find useful information about the sun and weather. The Moon has a strong influence on many spheres of life. Knowing moon phases and astrology helps you distribute the energy properly for days and use it most.<br> <br>Get interested in our Moon Phase application if you are:<br>\ud83c\udf11 Feeling the influence of the Moon on your body - the calendar of the Moon phases will allow you to carefully plan essential events in your life so that the Moon favors the implementation of your plans! With this application you can check about Full Moon, New Moon, First Quarter or Last Quarter and you can properly prepare for them. In addition, you can observe phenomena such as moon distance so you will know when the influence of the Moon is strong and when it is weak!<br>\ud83c\udf11 An amateur astronomy - with the visualization of the azimuths of the Moon and the Sun will allow a better understanding of the phenomena associated with them. Moon phase app provides a moon-observing index which is calculated according to the moon phenomena and weather such as cloud coverage and chance of rain.<br>\ud83c\udf11 A stargazer or moongazer - deeply absorbed in thought or contemplation, as if you were gazing at the moon with this lunar scope. Check out moon information before moon watching.<br>\ud83c\udf11 An outdoor photographer - the view of the sun allows you to check when there is a &quot;golden hour&quot; and &quot;blue hour&quot;, so you can plan to take beautiful and professional photos outdoors.<br> <br>Check out the full list of Moon Phase Calendar features:<br> <br>\ud83c\udf19 Moon parameters include:moon phase, moon age, moon distance, vertical angle, azimuth angle, luminance, moon rise and moon set...<br>\ud83c\udf19 Sun parameters include:sunrise, sunset, dawn, dusk, golden hour &amp; blue hour for photography...<br>\ud83c\udf19 Weather parameters include: cloud cover, chance of rain, visibility, daily weather, hourly weather...<br> <br>\ud83c\udf15 View the moon cycle for any date in the future or past by scrolling on the moon<br>\ud83c\udf15 Find the upcoming full moon or new moon straight on the main screen<br>\ud83c\udf15 Track all cycles of the moon: full moon, new moon, waning gibbous, waxing crescent, first quarter<br>\ud83c\udf15 Set moon phase as phone wallpaper, change in accordance with the real moon!<br> <br>Tips: to get local weather information, you\u2019ll need to grant location permission.<br> <br>If you want to keep up with the moon or other astronomy information, then <b> Moon Phase Calendar </b> is the right app for you.",
